ERROR:  dependent privileges exist
HINT:  Use CASCADE to revoke them too.
-- @@@ 27
REVOKE regress_priv_user1 FROM regress_priv_user2; -- fail
ERROR:  dependent privileges exist
HINT:  Use CASCADE to revoke them too.
